{"title": "Adroit Reflexes", "pageid": 28081, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Adroit_Reflexes", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Adroit Reflexes</b> is a passive feature that enhances your counterattacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you make an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> as a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a>, you make it with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halberd_of_Vigilance\" title=\"Halberd of Vigilance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Halberd_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Halberd_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Halberd_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Halberd_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Halberd_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Halberd_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Halberd_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Halberd_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Halberd_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Halberd_of_Vigilance\" title=\"Halberd of Vigilance\">Halberd of Vigilance</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203022\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1159/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8961/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2419/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1050948/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.810      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   41.810      1 -total\n 29.58%   12.369      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 28.65%   11.980      2 Template:Icon_text\n 27.30%   11.416     10 Template:Trim\n 26.94%   11.264      1 Template:Attack_Roll\n 23.52%    9.834      4 Template:Ifempty\n 19.38%    8.103      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 17.15%    7.171      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 12.10%    5.061      1 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28081-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203022 and revision id 371480. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}